                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""how-to-read-this-reference""><a class=""header"" href=""#how-to-read-thi"
                  & "s-reference"">How to read this reference</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>This reference documents the Ada packages that implement adacovex."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "It is generated from the source docstrings by <code>make doc</code>.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>End users</strong> need the CLI reference, the dashboard guide, "
                  & "and"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "the standards pages.  The <a href=""../cli-reference.html"">CLI reference</a>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "describes every flag.  The <a href=""../standards.html"">standards guide</a>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "explains the compliance levels.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Contributors</strong> use this reference together with the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<a href=""../../CONTRIBUTING.html"">contributing guide</a> and the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<a href=""../architecture.html"">architecture notes</a>.  The <a href=""adacove"
                  & "x-docstring-spec.html"">docstring"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "spec</a> defines the annotation"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "format.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Maintainers</strong> read the <a href=""../proof/index.html"">proo"
                  & "f ledger</a> for the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "verified-VC history and the <a href=""../changelogs/index.html"">changelogs</a"
                  & ">"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "for the release history.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Technical terms follow the controlled dictionary in"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<a href=""../ste100-technical-names.html"">STE100 Technical Names</a>.  All"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "documentation, including these pages, uses British English and"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English.  A word not in the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "dictionary means the sentence is not yet STE100-clean.</p>"
