                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "                        <h1 id=""adacovex-cicd""><a class=""header"" href=""#adac"
                  & "ovex-cicd"">adacovex CI/CD</a></h1>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""github-actions""><a class=""header"" href=""#github-actions"">GitHub Acti"
                  & "ons</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The composite action at <code>./action.yml</code> mirrors the base CLI. C"
                  & "I can drive every"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "assessment feature the same way the binary does.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""quick-start""><a class=""header"" href=""#quick-start"">Quick start</a></"
                  & "h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-yaml""># .github/workflows/adacovex.yml"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "on:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  push:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    branches: [main]"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  pull_request:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & ""
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "jobs:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  adacovex:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    runs-on: ubuntu-latest"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    steps:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      - uses: actions/checkout@v7"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      - uses: bladeacer/adacovex@v1"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "        with:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          target: ."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          standard: all          # DO-178C + ISO 26262 + IEC 62304"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          require-spark: Platinum"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          require-docstrings: 100"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          require-tests: 1173"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          run-tests: true"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          generate-sbom: true"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>This job builds adacovex. It runs the target"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s native tests and the full"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "assessment. It gates on Platinum SPARK, 100% docstring coverage, and 900"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "passing tests. On failure, the job publishes <code>adacovex-assessment</code"
                  & "> artifacts"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "and Markdown summaries.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""pr-coverage-gate""><a class=""header"" href=""#pr-coverage-gate"">PR cove"
                  & "rage gate</a></h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Use <code>--coverage-delta</code> to fail PRs that drop docstring coverag"
                  & "e:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-yaml""># .github/workflows/pr-coverage.yml"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "on:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  pull_request:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & ""
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "jobs:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  coverage-delta:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    runs-on: ubuntu-latest"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    steps:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      - uses: actions/checkout@v7"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "        with:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          fetch-depth: 0"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      - uses: bladeacer/adacovex@v1"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "        with:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          target: ."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "          coverage-delta: ${{ github.event.pull_request.base.sha }}"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""release-workflow""><a class=""header"" href=""#release-workflow"">Release"
                  & " workflow</a></h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Tag a release. The bundled workflow (<code>release.yml</code>) builds the"
                  & " binary and runs GNATprove. It validates the self-assessment. It publishes `"
                  & "adacovex-vX.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Y. Z.tar.gz<code> and the composite action bundle. Floating tags (</code>"
                  & "@latest<code>, </code>@v1<code>, </code>@v1.3<code>) always point at the new"
                  & "est release. Pin </code>@vX.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Y. Z` for reproducibility.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""gitlab-ci""><a class=""header"" href=""#gitlab-ci"">GitLab CI</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The same inputs map to GitLab CI variables:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-yaml""># .gitlab-ci.yml"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "adacovex:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  image: ubuntu:latest"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  before_script:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    - apt-get update -qq &amp;&amp; apt-get install -y -qq curl"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    - curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bladeacer/adacovex/main/i"
                  & "nstall.sh | bash"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  script:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    - adacovex --target=. --standard=all --dal=C --require-spark=Platinum --"
                  & "require-docstrings=100"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  artifacts:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    when: always"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    paths:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      - sbom.json"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      - docs/badges/*.svg"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>If your runner already has Alire, replace the <code>install.sh</code> ste"
                  & "p with"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>alr install covex gnatprove</code>.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""other-ci-systems""><a class=""header"" href=""#other-ci-systems"">Other C"
                  & "I systems</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The action is a pure composite of shell steps. It works on any runner tha"
                  & "t can"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "run <code>bash</code> and install Alire:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<ol>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>Install Alire + GNAT (<code>alr toolchain --install gnat_native</code>)."
                  & "</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>Download the release bundle or build from source.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>Run <code>adacovex</code> with the same flags as the GitHub Action input"
                  & "s.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</ol>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The JSON API (<code>/api/metrics</code> when using <code>--serve</code>, "
                  & "or <code>--emit-metrics</code>) lets"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "you parse results in any language.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><strong>Action/CLI/docs parity is a feature gate.</strong> <code>ci.yml</"
                  & "code> runs"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>make action-parity-check</code> (wired into <code>make check</code>). "
                  & "The build fails when the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "action"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s inputs stop mirroring the base CLI option set. The build also fails"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "when the <code>### Inputs</code> table below drifts from <code>action.yml</c"
                  & "ode>. See"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>tools/check-action-parity.py</code> for the mapping rules.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""composite-action-actionyml""><a class=""header"" href=""#composite-actio"
                  & "n-actionyml"">Composite action (<code>./action.yml</code>)</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The composite action installs Alire via"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<a href=""https://github.com/alire-project/setup-alire""><code>alire-project/s"
                  & "etup-alire</code></a>."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "GNAT comes from <code>gnat-version</code> plus <code>gprbuild</code>. <code>"
                  & "gnatprove</code> is NOT an"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>alr toolchain</code> component. The <code>prove</code> subcommand reso"
                  & "lves it through the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "target project"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s manifest, <code>$PATH</code>, cached toolchain, or download.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The action obtains the version-matched adacovex binary. It downloads the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "release bundle by default. You can set <code>build: true</code> to build fro"
                  & "m source.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Optionally, the action runs GNATprove (<code>prove</code>) and the native"
                  & " tests"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "(<code>run-tests</code>). Then it runs the assessment. It generates a proof-"
                  & "aware SBOM"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "(<code>generate-sbom</code>, default <code>true</code>). It publishes a Mark"
                  & "down step summary,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "machine-readable outputs, and SVG badge artifacts.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>run-tests</code> <strong>builds the target"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s native test suite first</strong>. In a consumer"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "workspace, the <code>build: true</code> step builds adacovex in a scratch ch"
                  & "eckout. It"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "leaves the target untouched.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The action runs <code>alr build</code> in the target root before executin"
                  & "g"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>test-command</code>. The target root is a subdirectory when <code>targ"
                  & "et</code> points at one."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "In the self-assessment case, the build is an incremental no-op.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>This design keeps <code>test-command: ./test_crdt</code>-style usage work"
                  & "ing in consumer"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "repositories such as Ada_CRDT"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s release workflow.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The action is version-matched to the adacovex binary. The release workflo"
                  & "w bundles <code>adacovex-vX. Y. Z.tar.gz</code> for every `vX.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Y. Z` tag. The action downloads the binary for the tag it is referenced b"
                  & "y. Reference it by a floating tag to always get the latest published release"
                  & ".</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>You can pin to an exact release for reproducibility:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-yaml"">steps:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  - uses: actions/checkout@v7"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "  - uses: bladeacer/adacovex@v1"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "    with:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      target: ."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "      standard: all   # badges/reports for DO-178C + ISO 26262 + IEC 62304"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""inputs""><a class=""header"" href=""#inputs"">Inputs</a></h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<table>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<thead>"
                  & ASCII.LF
