                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "                        <h1 id=""contributor-guide-codebase-structure-and-set"
                  & "up""><a class=""header"" href=""#contributor-guide-codebase-structure-and-setup"""
                  & ">Contributor guide: codebase structure and setup</a></h1>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>This page is a human-readable tour of the adacovex codebase for people wh"
                  & "o want"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "to build, test, or modify it. It supplements"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<a href=""../CONTRIBUTING.html"">CONTRIBUTING.md</a> (process, changelog forma"
                  & "t, PR rules)."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "This page is about <strong>how the code is organised and how to get a workin"
                  & "g"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "development environment</strong>. <code>AGENTS.md</code> is the machine-faci"
                  & "ng version of the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "same information.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""setting-up-the-repository""><a class=""header"" href=""#setting-up-the-r"
                  & "epository"">Setting up the repository</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Prerequisites:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Alire</strong> &gt;= 2.0 (<code>alr</code>) "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(147)
                  & " the Ada package manager. It downloads and manages"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "the GNAT toolchain for you.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>GNAT</strong> Ada compiler "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(147)
                  & " managed by Alire (<code>alr</code> pulls <code>gnat_native</code>).</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Python 3</strong> "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(147)
                  & " only for build/dev tooling (<code>tools/*.py</code>). The shipped binary"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "has no Python dependency.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>gnatprove</strong> "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(147)
                  & " optional for <em>using</em> adacovex, required for <code>make prove</code>."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "It is resolved at run time (manifest pin, <code>$PATH</code>, cached toolcha"
                  & "in, or"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "download). It lives in the dev manifest, never the published one.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">git clone https://github.com/bladeacer/adac"
                  & "ovex.git"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "cd adacovex"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "make build        # compiles bin/adacovex + bin/test_runner (covex alias)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "make test         # builds + runs the native test suite (1173 tests)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "make run-self     # assess adacovex itself: 100% docs, Platinum, DAL-C"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "make prove        # SPARK proof (Platinum gate) + regenerates docs/badges/"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "make check        # the whole quality gate CI runs before a release"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>make check</code> is the pre-commit gate. It runs cheap static chec"
                  & "ks first (ASCII, SPARK_Mode-Off policy, changelog format, version source, do"
                  & "c-links, markdown links). Then it runs build, tests, proof, docs, and SBOM. "
                  & "Then it runs tree-wide count-sync checks.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Everything must pass. The sync checks fail loudly when a count in any doc"
                  & "umentation file is stale.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""repository-tour""><a class=""header"" href=""#repository-tour"">Repositor"
                  & "y tour</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code>src/"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- adacovex_main.adb              -- CLI entry point: parse -&gt; pipeline "
                  & "-&gt; render -&gt; exit"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- adacovex.ads                   -- Version constant"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- core/                          -- config parsing, types, cache, VCS, GNA"
                  & "Tprove runner, diff"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- parsers/                       -- input parsing: Ada source, gnatprove.o"
                  & "ut, tests, manifest, HLR/LLR"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- renderers/                     -- output: ANSI, HTML dashboard, Markdown"
                  & ", SVG badges, SBOM, man page"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- compliance/                    -- DO-178C DAL assessment logic"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- server/                        -- HTTP/1.1 server (4-worker task pool) f"
                  & "or --serve"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "|-- ir/                            -- bounded IR types + future-use synthesi"
                  & "ser"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "`-- tests/                         -- the native test suite (test_runner ent"
                  & "ry point)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "resources/dashboard.html           -- the served dashboard's page shell (pla"
                  & "in HTML, bundled at build time)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "tools/*.py                         -- pure-stdlib Python: doc sync, count sy"
                  & "nc, generators, validators"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "docs/                              -- all documentation (this guide, CLI ref"
                  & "erence, standards, and more)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The <strong>execution pipeline</strong> (<code>adacovex_main.adb</code>) "
                  & "is the spine of the tool:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code>parse CLI -&gt; scan .ads sources -&gt; apply docstring patches -"
                  & "&gt; compute doc metrics"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "-&gt; parse gnatprove.out -&gt; parse test results -&gt; assess DAL -&gt; re"
                  & "nder ANSI report"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "-&gt; emit SVG badges -&gt; emit Markdown reports -&gt; emit SBOM -&gt; serv"
                  & "e dashboard (if --serve)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "-&gt; exit code (0 = Achieved)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>A handful of modes exit before the pipeline: <code>--help</code>, <code>-"
                  & "-version</code>, <code>man</code>,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>status</code>, the differential modes (<code>--compare-base</code> / <"
                  & "code>--coverage-delta</code>), and"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>sbom</code>.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""where-things-live""><a class=""header"" href=""#where-things-live"">Where"
                  & " things live</a></h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<div class=""table-wrapper"">"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<table>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<thead>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><th>You want to"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(166)
                  & "</th><th>Look at</th></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</thead>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tbody>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Understand the CLI flags</td><td><code>src/core/adacovex-config.ads/"
                  & ".adb</code> (parser + <code>help</code> topics)</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Add a new flag</td><td>Parse it in <code>adacovex-config.adb</code>,"
                  & " store it in <code>CLI_Config</code>, add a contextual <code>help</code> top"
                  & "ic</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Change source scanning</td><td><code>src/parsers/adacovex-parsers-so"
                  & "urce.ads/.adb</code></td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Add a parser for a new input</td><td>New file under <code>src/parser"
                  & "s/</code>, wired into the pipeline in <code>adacovex_main.adb</code></td></t"
                  & "r>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Add an output format</td><td>New renderer under <code>src/renderers/"
                  & "</code>, called from the pipeline</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Change the dashboard page</td><td>Edit <code>resources/dashboard.htm"
                  & "l</code> (plain HTML/CSS/JS), then run <code>tools/gen-dashboard.py</code> t"
                  & "o regenerate <code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code></td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Change assessment criteria</td><td><code>src/compliance/adacovex-com"
                  & "pliance-dal.adb</code> (+ the DAL levels doc)</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Add tests</td><td><code>src/tests/</code> "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(147)
                  & " see below</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Regenerate API docs</td><td><code>make doc</code> (gnatdoc -&gt; <co"
                  & "de>tools/rst2md.py</code> -&gt; <code>docs/api-docs/</code>)</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Regenerate the offline manual</td><td><code>make book</code> (mdBook"
                  & " -&gt; <code>tools/gen-docs.py</code> -&gt; <code>src/adacovex-docs_template"
                  & ".ads</code>)</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Sync test counts</td><td><code>make test-count</code> (reads <code>d"
                  & "ocs/test_result.md</code>, rewrites every anchored count)</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Sync proof metrics</td><td><code>make proof-status</code></td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Regenerate AGENTS.md blocks</td><td><code>make agents-tree</code> (s"
                  & "rc tree) and <code>make doc-links</code> (docs list)</td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<tr><td>Verify markdown links</td><td><code>make link-check</code></td></tr>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</tbody>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</table>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</div>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""api-docs-and-cross-links""><a class=""header"" href=""#api-docs-and-cros"
                  & "s-links"">API docs and cross-links</a></h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>make doc</code> regenerates <code>docs/api-docs/</code> from the <c"
                  & "ode>.ads</code> docstrings via gnatdoc + <code>tools/rst2md.py</code>. It pr"
                  & "oduces one page per package plus <code>index.md</code>. The six hand-written"
                  & " reference pages are never regenerated. They are the docstring spec, the tes"
                  & "t formats, the SPARK levels, and the DAL, ASIL, and Class level pages.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Cross-links between the generated package pages and the reference pages l"
                  & "ive in <code>tools/rst2md.py</code>. <code>GUIDE_PAGES</code> builds the ind"
                  & "ex"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(156)
                  & "Guides"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(157)
                  & " section. <code>PACKAGE_GUIDES</code> builds the per-package "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(156)
                  & "See also"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(157)
                  & " lines. They do <strong>not</strong> live in the <code>.ads</code> comments:"
                  & " gnatdoc parses comment text as RST and drops markdown link URLs. To add a p"
                  & "ackage cross-link, extend <code>PACKAGE_GUIDES</code> in <code>tools/rst2md."
                  & "py</code>. Then run <code>make doc</code> and <code>make link-check</code>.<"
                  & "/p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h3 id=""offline-manual-and-read-the-docs""><a class=""header"" href=""#offline-m"
                  & "anual-and-read-the-docs"">Offline manual and Read the Docs</a></h3>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>docs/</code> is an mdBook project (<code>docs/book.toml</code> with"
                  & " <code>src = "".""</code> and a root <code>docs/SUMMARY.md</code>). Read the D"
                  & "ocs builds the public site from it; the same book is bundled into the binary"
                  & " as the offline manual. When you add, move, or rename a doc page, update <co"
                  & "de>docs/SUMMARY.md</code> in the same change. Then run <code>make book</code"
                  & "> (regenerates <code>src/adacovex-docs_template.ads</code>), <code>make link"
                  & "-check</code>, and <code>make docs-check</code>. <code>make book-serve</code"
                  & "> serves the manual locally with mdBook"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s live server.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""testing""><a class=""header"" href=""#testing"">Testing</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The test suite is native and zero-dependency. <code>src/tests/</code> hol"
                  & "ds one file per category (scanner, config, types, renderers, SBOM, VCS, and "
                  & "more). Each file exposes a <code>Run (R : in out Runner'Class)</code> proced"
                  & "ure wired into <code>src/tests/test_runner.adb</code>. A test is a <code>R. "
                  & "Check (Condition, ""Description"")</code> call.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The runner counts them, prints a per-category table, and writes <code>doc"
                  & "s/test_result.md</code>.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-ada"">-- src/tests/adacovex_scanner_tests.adb (pat"
                  & "tern to follow)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "Adacovex.Parsers.Source.Scan_Ads_File (Tmp_File, Pkg, Success);"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "R.Check (Success, ""Test 1: parse succeeded"");"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>After adding or removing tests:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<pre><code class=""language-bash"">make test          # rebuild + run; rewrite"
                  & "s docs/test_result.md"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "make test-count    # sync every anchored count across the repo (AGENTS.md,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "                   # README, Makefile, CI workflows, manifests, agents-tree."
                  & "map)"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</code></pre>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The count-sync is enforced by <code>make check</code>. A test change that"
                  & " skips the sync fails the gate. Tests write to <code>/tmp</code> scratch dir"
                  & "s and clean up after themselves. The default on-disk result cache (<code>~/."
                  & "adacovex/cache</code>) is shared.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Tests that exercise caching use content-hashed keys. They never depend on"
                  & " each other"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s state.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""documentation-and-dashboard-tooling""><a class=""header"" href=""#docume"
                  & "ntation-and-dashboard-tooling"">Documentation and dashboard tooling</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The pure-stdlib Python gates keep the docs and the dashboard in step with"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "the code.  They are the drop-in replacements for the npm tools (stylelint,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "and more) that a JavaScript toolchain would use; adacovex keeps its dev"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "tooling Python-only by convention:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><code>tools/csslint.py</code> (<code>make csslint-check</code>) enforces"
                  & " the 4px spacing rule:"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "every <code>margin</code>, <code>padding</code>, and <code>gap</code> pixel "
                  & "length is a multiple of 4px."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "It runs inside <code>make build</code> and <code>make check</code>.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><code>tools/check-docs.py</code> (<code>make docs-check</code>) fails wh"
                  & "en any paragraph in the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "user docs, README, or human changelogs exceeds four sentences, and it"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "rejects em dashes and Latin abbreviations (<code>i.e.</code>, <code>e.g.</co"
                  & "de>, <code>etc.</code>)."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>tools/para-split.py</code> rewraps over-long paragraphs to comply.</li"
                  & ">"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><code>tools/gen-dashboard.py</code> bundles the dashboard resources into"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>src/adacovex-dashboard_template.ads</code> and minifies the authored C"
                  & "SS and"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "JavaScript (comments stripped, whitespace collapsed) before inlining.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>Edit the dashboard under <code>resources/</code>, never the generated tem"
                  & "plate.  After"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "any docs or resource change, run <code>make docs-check</code> and <code>make"
                  & " csslint-check</code>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "before committing.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""spark-proof-discipline""><a class=""header"" href=""#spark-proof-discipl"
                  & "ine"">SPARK proof discipline</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>make prove</code> runs gnatprove through the <code>prove</code> sub"
                  & "command and enforces the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "Platinum gate: <strong>0 unproved VCs and 0 justified VCs</strong>. The rule"
                  & "s that keep the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "proof tractable:</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>Every user assertion and every runtime check must be proved.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>No <code>pragma Assume</code> / <code>pragma Annotate</code> justificati"
                  & "ons.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>No <code>pragma SPARK_Mode (Off)</code> anywhere except <code>Types.Impl"
                  & "ementation</code> and"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>Complexity</code> (the two non-formal-<code>Ada.Containers</code> pack"
                  & "ages. Non-formal"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>Ada.Containers</code> are illegal in SPARK_Mode-On code "
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(147)
                  & " gnatprove rejects"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "them; the evidence is in <code>docs/proof/16.1.0-ledger.md</code>. <code>mak"
                  & "e spark-off-check</code> enforces this.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li>I/O- and container-heavy units are default-off bodies or carry per-subpr"
                  & "ogram"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>SPARK_Mode =&gt; On</code> aspects. They never carry an explicit Off p"
                  & "ragma.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p>The proof result is anchored in <code>docs/proof/</code> (the per-version"
                  & " VC ledger)."
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>make proof-status</code> syncs the VC count and SPARK level into the d"
                  & "ocs.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""common-workflows""><a class=""header"" href=""#common-workflows"">Common "
                  & "workflows</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Assess another project</strong>: <code>adacovex --target=PATH --"
                  & "dal=C</code> (see"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<a href=""target-projects.html"">Target projects</a>).</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Dogfood</strong>: <code>make run-self</code> (adacovex against i"
                  & "tself) and <code>make run-ada-crdt</code> (against the sibling <code>../Ada_"
                  & "CRDT</code> checkout, strict mode). Both"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "must stay green.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Coverage gate between releases</strong>: <code>make coverage-gat"
                  & "e</code> compares docstring"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "coverage between the latest two release tags.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Prepare a release</strong>: <code>make bump-version VERSION=x.y."
                  & "z</code>, write the changelog"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "(<code>docs/changelogs/adacovex-x.y.z.md</code>, canonical format enforced b"
                  & "y <code>make changelog-check</code>), then <code>make release VERSION=x.y.z<"
                  & "/code>.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Keep docs current</strong>: every code change updates the releva"
                  & "nt user docs,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "the Ada docstrings that feed <code>docs/api-docs</code>, and the changelog, "
                  & "then"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "re-runs the sync gates (<code>make docs-check</code>, <code>make action-pari"
                  & "ty-check</code>,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>make agents-tree</code>, <code>make doc-links</code>, <code>make link-"
                  & "check</code>).  Stale docs are a"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "release blocker.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<li><strong>Debug</strong>: <code>adacovex --verbose</code> prints pipeline "
                  & "step diagnostics. <code>adacovex status</code> reports toolchain + platform "
                  & "state. <code>--no-cache</code> bypasses the"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "on-disk result cache when inputs changed without content changing.</li>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "</ul>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""related-pages""><a class=""header"" href=""#related-pages"">Related pages"
                  & "</a></h2>"
