                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""building-the-manual""><a class=""header"" href=""#building-the-manual"">B"
                  & "uilding the manual</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>docs/</code> is an <strong>mdBook</strong> project (<code>book.toml"
                  & "</code> with <code>src = "".""</code>, root"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>SUMMARY.md</code>).  Read the Docs builds the public site from it (see"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>.readthedocs.yaml</code>).  Build it locally with <code>mdbook build d"
                  & "ocs</code>, serve it"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "with <code>make book-serve</code> (mdBook"
                  & Character'Val(226)
                  & Character'Val(128)
                  & Character'Val(153)
                  & "s live server) or <code>make docs-serve</code> (a plain"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "HTTP server), and bundle it into the binary as the offline manual with"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>make book</code> (or <code>make build</code>, which runs it).  The <co"
                  & "de>--serve</code> dashboard serves"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "the bundled manual at <code>/docs</code>.</p>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<h2 id=""generated-outputs""><a class=""header"" href=""#generated-outputs"">Gener"
                  & "ated outputs</a></h2>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<p><code>docs/compliance/VERIFICATION.md</code>, <code>docs/compliance/TRACE"
                  & ".md</code>,"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>docs/compliance/HLR.md</code>, and <code>docs/compliance/LLR.md</code>"
                  & " are generated per"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "target.  <code>docs/badges/*.svg</code> are regenerated by <code>make run-se"
                  & "lf</code> and"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "<code>make prove</code>.  <code>docs/api-docs/</code> is regenerated by <cod"
                  & "e>make doc</code>.  <code>docs/book/</code>"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "is the mdBook build output and is gitignored.  Do not edit generated files b"
                  & "y"
                  & ASCII.LF
                  & "hand; regenerate them instead.</p>"
